{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11113060","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11113060","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1111306001:0":{"text":"Our home is finally nice and clean again! Mama is going to be pleased when she gets back.","source_cn":"家里终于恢复整洁啦！妈妈回来就不会训我啦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93B0CDFB49747AE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111306002:0":{"text":"Here, these herbs will help to stop the bleeding. Take them and help your friend.","source_cn":"这是止血的草药，总算找到了，送给你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD56AD906AF300C3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:4::0":{"text":"Medicinal Herb","source_cn":"止血的草药","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC347260626D5CE8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111306003:0":{"text":"Thank you for your help.","source_cn":"谢谢，我收下了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77DF85146691296B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111306004:0":{"text":"All she needs now is rest. Satrana should be back on her feet soon.","source_cn":"接下来只需稍加休息，萨忒娜应该会很快醒过来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AAD067123CD562D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111306005:0":{"text":"My house is too small for everyone to stay, but maybe <style=\"highlight\">Rhys</style> has room for you.","source_cn":"我家里太小了，没地方让你们歇息，你们去<style=h...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB5C995716D8BAC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111306006:0":{"text":"Rhys? What an interesting name.","source_cn":"诡草？在你们这个氏族，大家的名字还挺奇特。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55810E0E50460A13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1111306007:0":{"text":"Rhys is incredible! He's the best beast tamer in the whole desert!","source_cn":"诡草大哥很了不起，他是这片沙漠里最厉害的驯兽师！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD97F97219C24323","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1111306008:0":{"text":"The Quicksand Claws kept pestering him about his terrabird training techniques. But when he turned them down, they kidnapped him!","source_cn":"流沙之爪都要向他询问驯养陆行鸟的技巧，他不肯教，流沙之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA4E6E5D9C63D023","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111306009:0":{"text":"Quicksand Claws... Terrabirds...","source_cn":"流沙之爪……陆行鸟……","status":"matched","has